# Example 17: a per-residue displacement field.
# Checkpoint state 7Z4L to catalytic state 7Z4J, Pacesa et al. 2022,
# Nature 609:191, superposed on the RuvC core.
#
# This is the third and finest-grained way this stylebook shows motion:
#
#   example 12, a morph, for feeling the motion
#   example 15, one arrow per domain at true length, for measuring it
#   this one, an arrow per residue, for seeing which parts of a domain
#   move together and where a hinge sits
#
# Use it when the interesting thing is the pattern rather than the
# magnitude: a domain swinging as a rigid body gives parallel arrows of
# graded length, a hinge shows up as a sign change, and a region that
# refolds gives arrows pointing in unrelated directions.
#
# Porcupine plots are usually drawn with the arrows scaled up, because
# for a small conformational change true-length arrows cannot be seen.
# This motion is not small, so the arrows here are true length and the
# caption says so. If you do scale, put the factor on the figure.
open 7z4l
open 7z4j
open ../../palettes/lab_colors.cxc

delete #1/A,C,D
delete #2/A,C,c,D

# Superpose on the RuvC core, the part that does not move. Every arrow in
# this figure is a displacement relative to that core.
matchmaker #2/B:1-59,909-1098 to #1/B:1-59,909-1098

open ../../presets/Base/publication_white.cxc

# Only the start state is shown. The end state stays open because the
# script needs its coordinates, but drawing both would put a second
# cartoon behind the arrows for no gain.
hide #2 models
color #1/B lab_gray_p
cartoon style xsection oval width 1.0 thickness 0.28

runscript draw_vectors.py

view #1
turn y -30
view #1 pad 0.06

key "#440154:0" #3b528b: #21918c: #5ec962: "#fde725:35+" pos 0.04,0.30 size 0.03,0.36 fontSize 16 labelSide right/bottom colorTreatment blended
2dlabels text "displacement (Å)" xpos 0.03 ypos 0.72 size 17 color lab_black bold true
2dlabels text "checkpoint to catalytic" xpos 0.03 ypos 0.95 size 22 color lab_black bold true
2dlabels text "7Z4L to 7Z4J, superposed on RuvC" xpos 0.03 ypos 0.91 size 15 color lab_gray
2dlabels text "one arrow per 5th residue, true length" xpos 0.03 ypos 0.04 size 15 color lab_gray

save vector_field.png width 3000 supersample 3
